    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: a698579171ed0ac72bc16aec5df41d6d364f45f9 -->\n**Needs changes before merge.** The PR's own delta (c93678aa) is clean: `ElectrodeFromFaces` is undoable and ships its MCP tool, there are provenance lines, and there is no unwrap/expect/panic. The blockers are the same three inherited from #1131's old head as on #1136: the UI `Electrode` arm, the missing `edm_at_post` refusal, and the unbounded gap. Merge order: #1131, then #1136, then this PR.\n\nThe maintainer's dcaa3a36 notes are still open: `sinker_faces.rs:123-127` turns `world_facets` `None` into an empty list via `unwrap_or_default` (it should refuse, per the Prime Directive), the `standing_in` docs note, and an undersize-0/non-zero-gap warning.\n\n**Tests (own head):** motion lib 207 and app lib 148 pass. sinker_electrode 8, sinker_electrode_mcp 1, sinker_burn 7, sinker_undersize 5, mcp 18, commands_undo 30 and golden_cl 25 pass. Clippy is clean. The UI was not run (inherited break). There is one extra mechanical conflict, in `mcp/tools.rs` (keep both `.chain(...)` lines).\n- **Conflicts with main (for the merge-time refresh):** about 28-29 files, ~59 hunks, all from main's wire EDM (#532/#551/#560) and this stack both appending an op, section and family to the same lists.\n  - About 50 hunks are mechanical (keep both): `kinds.rs`, `OpParams` arms, `sel.rs`, `sane.rs`, `params.rs`, `posting.rs`, `project/mod.rs`, ui `icons.rs`/`op_icons.rs`/`panes.rs`/`params_page.rs`, `generate.rs`, `job.rs`, `lathe_voice_tests.rs`, `coarse_laws.rs`.\n  - Judgement: the stored op tag (Wire Contour took 41, so `SinkerBurn` becomes 42, and `KIND_COUNT` and the `ribbon.rs` last-kind assertion follow); `stamp.rs` (the sinker tool/electrode digest against main's \"mounts no library tool\" branch - hand-merge so both survive); `params.rs` DTO ids (no stored id may move).\n  - #1131 must be refreshed first.\n\n_Review by the M5 PR-reviewer agent (mkinney collaborator session, PROCESS_VERSION 32). Reviewed on the PR head; the sinker chain is on hold, so it was not refreshed._\n",
